  emit: Final mediated Rust broker gate\nCurrent hardware and protected commit\nOriginal consumption and live Policy {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  reset: Old worker and late completion\nReject stale session / fence / cut\nKeep original history and obligations {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: unknown
  }
